    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Announcements</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Announcements will be posted here!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third Shift is the first ever hybrid, point-and-click, survival horror video game, to take place in a pharmacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/ac92e75f905f1f88cb752ac61910f2ec.avif?t=1752155053\" data-has-big width=800 height=2310 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/23474d4cbbd80a8a2ec291fd087cbfa1.avif?t=1752155053\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/9f0095f4aa332c5c8bce0807e2ccca24.avif?t=1752155053\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/9f68abea86ea6509ffa17cbaa5fa9528.avif?t=1752155053\" data-has-big width=800 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/c6827d1dcf9cdd50f3d3e9e51f015431.avif?t=1752155053\" data-has-big width=800 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/30eafeced7dc5bfb327aaaf2f3d30ec6.avif?t=1752155053\" data-has-big width=800 height=672 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/30ec819b311c9ec455b1b51ebc1c3d7c.avif?t=1752155053\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third Shift is a first-of-its-kind survival horror game set in the eerie, high-stakes world of a late-night pharmacy. You play as a pharmacist under extreme pressure, not just from managing dangerous drug interactions and corporate metrics, but from confronting terrifying supernatural threats that unfold with every shift. Combining point-and-click mechanics with sit-and-survive gameplay, Third Shift blends fast-paced reflexes, immersive storytelling, and chilling psychological tension in a setting that\u2019s never been explored in horror gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/4c1f772dcda06d10ff8327a379dadc60.avif?t=1752155053\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the scenes, I\u2019ve composed over 36 original music tracks planned for the final game, carefully designed to heighten tension, reinforce narrative themes, and shape the player\u2019s emotional experience. New animations, refined mechanics, and deeper narrative elements have also been developed, hinting at a dark conspiracy spanning centuries. Every update is shaped by the amazing feedback from our community, and now, we\u2019re inviting you to become part of that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third Shift is the first ever hybrid, point-and-click, survival horror video game, to take place in a pharmacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/ac92e75f905f1f88cb752ac61910f2ec.avif?t=1752155053\" data-has-big width=800 height=2310 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/23474d4cbbd80a8a2ec291fd087cbfa1.avif?t=1752155053\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/9f0095f4aa332c5c8bce0807e2ccca24.avif?t=1752155053\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/9f68abea86ea6509ffa17cbaa5fa9528.avif?t=1752155053\" data-has-big width=800 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/c6827d1dcf9cdd50f3d3e9e51f015431.avif?t=1752155053\" data-has-big width=800 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/30eafeced7dc5bfb327aaaf2f3d30ec6.avif?t=1752155053\" data-has-big width=800 height=672 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/30ec819b311c9ec455b1b51ebc1c3d7c.avif?t=1752155053\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third Shift is a first-of-its-kind survival horror game set in the eerie, high-stakes world of a late-night pharmacy. You play as a pharmacist under extreme pressure, not just from managing dangerous drug interactions and corporate metrics, but from confronting terrifying supernatural threats that unfold with every shift. Combining point-and-click mechanics with sit-and-survive gameplay, Third Shift blends fast-paced reflexes, immersive storytelling, and chilling psychological tension in a setting that\u2019s never been explored in horror gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/4c1f772dcda06d10ff8327a379dadc60.avif?t=1752155053\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the scenes, I\u2019ve composed over 36 original music tracks planned for the final game, carefully designed to heighten tension, reinforce narrative themes, and shape the player\u2019s emotional experience. New animations, refined mechanics, and deeper narrative elements have also been developed, hinting at a dark conspiracy spanning centuries. Every update is shaped by the amazing feedback from our community, and now, we\u2019re inviting you to become part of that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "As the lead pharmacist in Third Shift, you are in charge of keeping the Sycorax Everyday Remedies pharmacy safe through the store's closed hours at night from anything that may want enter the property. Will you survive the night and uncover the hidden truth?",
